# WFORMTD.KEY - Cancel with and without changes;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTD.SNP.
# Nothing changed: ESC leaves at once.
K F3
K ESC
S SAME
# A change: ESC asks first, and No keeps the dialog as it was.
K F3
T C
K ESC
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
# The Cancel button asks too; Yes leaves, the change unsaved.
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
S CANCELB
K ENTER
S ASK2
K Y
S LEFT
K F4
S VIEW
# View mode leaves without asking.
K ESC
S VIEWESC
# A changed memo alone asks too, and its text is not kept.
K F5 CTRL-TAB CEND
T !
K ESC
S MEMOASK
K Y
K F6
S MEMOKEPT
K ESC
